cted monuments (the list of scheduled monuments in Derbyshire Dales has about twenty entries in Beeley parish, among them several on Beeley Moor; the guidestone is Grade II listed). [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scheduled_monuments_in_Derbyshire_Dales]; Its highest point is 371 metres above sea level. [SUPPORTED: https://www.mudandroutes.com/summit/beeley-moor/]"}]'::jsonb),
